France–Brazil circulation, in three material registers
I
Grammar
Ripa’s Iconologia travels as a manual. Debret, trained in Davidian neoclassicism, works inside that tradition.
II
Training
Décio Villares studies with Cabanel and shows at the 1874 Paris Salon. In 1889 he draws the globe of the flag and paints the Republic in a green Phrygian cap.
III
Body and matter
Marianne enters the palace as sculpture. French gold enters the bank reserve as law, by decree, in December 1890.
